hashes in examples/validation/windows_handoff/native/owner_source/source-pins.json.
The public Microsoft Win32 and NVIDIA NVML API references are recorded beside
their implementations. Imported Strata code retains its upstream MIT notices.
The new Hermes recovery adapter consumes the pinned public SDK and preserves
native history; it copies no Hermes runtime implementation into the adapter.

