The Peak EWMA update in src/adaptive_inference/costs.py is adapted from Twitter Finagle,
revision 9cc08d15216497bb03a1cafda96b7266cfbbcff1, Apache License 2.0.
Its source attribution, license and notice are in third_party/finagle/.
The optional runtime timing mode also adapts Finagle's endpoint-bound metric
lifecycle: requests retain the learner captured at dispatch across completion,
and a verified replacement runtime receives a fresh existing learner.

The bounded arrival-offset scheduling design is informed by NVIDIA Dynamo;
no Dynamo implementation is included in the portable runtime. See docs/research.md
and REFERENCES.bib.

